{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb32th1iq7hia9uaRL1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't remove offline mode yet. Investigate for about a week, then decide.**\n\nThe 60% drop began the week the toggle's screen was redesigned. That points to a change in how users reach the feature, not a change in how much they want it. Removing it now would mean acting on a probable measurement or discoverability artifact.\n\n**Why the evidence doesn't support removal**\n- The timing fits a regression: the toggle may be buried, renamed, broken, or reset by the redesign.\n- Silent tickets don't show that nobody cares. Users who can't find a feature usually give up quietly, and offline users are often the ones with poor connectivity, who are the least likely to write in.\n- \"Usage\" might measure toggle-on events and not real offline sessions. Those are different things.\n\n**Cheap checks, using existing data only**\n1. Split the drop by app version. If it only appears on the redesigned build, the redesign is the cause.\n2. Compare users who already had offline mode on before the redesign with users who would have to switch it on now. If existing users kept using it, demand is intact and discoverability is the problem.\n3. Check for a bug: did the toggle persist, and did the redesign reset or fail to save it?\n4. Look at the redesigned screen's funnel, from views to taps on the toggle to enabling it.\n5. Look at who the offline users were, such as heavy or high-retention users and any particular segments. Check whether their retention changed after the drop.\n\n**Decision rule**\n- If the cause is discoverability or a bug, fix or restore the toggle and re-measure over 2–4 weeks.\n- If existing users still use it and its value is low, removal is defensible. Give notice and a deprecation window.\n- Ask engineering for the real maintenance cost of offline mode. \"Simplify the codebase\" is a benefit that needs a number."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3450,"cache_read_input_tokens":4972,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3450},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d107d19-9242-4b50-9bee-2cc03cf6360d","uuid":"2819e383-1d37-4a08-afa9-3ccd2b54b431","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:13:22.924Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb32XcPqzcazXvBuJ7z"}
